        You will be given the root cause of a bug, the commit message and the corresponding patch.
        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by improper handling of the IRQs and auxiliary timers during the reset process of the Intel graphics engine, which could lead to incomplete requests and potential system instability. The previous implementation did not adequately manage the state of the breadcrumbs and timers, resulting in missed IRQs and incorrect timeout handling.

        Commit message:
        drm/i915: Reset the breadcrumbs IRQ more carefully

